<title>USA: Home Depot names Ronald Matricaria to board.</title>
<headline>Home Depot names Ronald Matricaria to board.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Depot Inc said Thursday it had named Ronald Matricaria to the board, increasing the number of members to 12.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders of record April 1 were sent proxies asking them to affirm the addition of Matricaria, who is the current chairman, chief executive and president of St. Jude Medical Inc.</p>
<p>The retail company said its annual meeting will be held on May 28 in Atlanta.</p>
</text>
